(1085979, 132090, 30861, '<td valign="top">A virtually flawless image, and an extraordinarily poignant one. I would only wish for a little more "life" in the dog''s right eye (left as we view it). Well done!</td>', 'A virtually flawless image, and an extraordinarily poignant one. I would only wish for a little more "life" in the dog''s right eye (left as we view it). Well done!', '2005-01-02 00:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1085981, 132340, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, beautiful picture. Tonalities to die for. By far the best of this genre of image netered.</td>', 'Beautiful, beautiful picture. Tonalities to die for. By far the best of this genre of image netered.', '2005-01-02 00:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1085984, 132386, 30861, '<td valign="top">Strikingly surreal image. I wish the apple weren''t touching the cloud on lower right quadrant, and wish the hot spot on the apple were less of an eyetrap.</td>', 'Strikingly surreal image. I wish the apple weren''t touching the cloud on lower right quadrant, and wish the hot spot on the apple were less of an eyetrap.', '2005-01-02 00:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1085986, 132015, 30861, '<td valign="top">Well, I know who shot this one LOL. It''s hysterical and sly. Gotta love it.</td>', 'Well, I know who shot this one LOL. It''s hysterical and sly. Gotta love it.', '2005-01-02 00:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1085987, 132412, 30861, '<td valign="top">I love what''s happening on the right, the notebook and the pen. The softness and the vague sepia tones are very poignant. The lamp on the left isn''t working anywhere near as well, it''s blocked up. The small, isolated light spot lwer left third is a distraction. So I have mixed feelings here.</td>', 'I love what''s happening on the right, the notebook and the pen. The softness and the vague sepia tones are very poignant. The lamp on the left isn''t working anywhere near as well, it''s blocked up. The small, isolated light spot lwer left third is a distraction. So I have mixed feelings here.', '2005-01-02 00:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1085988, 132344, 30861, '<td valign="top">Title alone is a winner. I like it very much conceptually and compositionally. I''m bothered by the snow areas behind and to left of figure, which have not picked up the sepia tone and seem an anomaly.</td>', 'Title alone is a winner. I like it very much conceptually and compositionally. I''m bothered by the snow areas behind and to left of figure, which have not picked up the sepia tone and seem an anomaly.', '2005-01-02 00:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1085990, 131762, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s a beutiful, moody image. I''m not sure it''s working so well as an entry in this particular challenge.</td>', 'It''s a beutiful, moody image. I''m not sure it''s working so well as an entry in this particular challenge.', '2005-01-02 00:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1085992, 132231, 1368, '<td valign="top">I love it :D absolutely beautiful!</td>', 'I love it :D absolutely beautiful!', '2005-01-02 00:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1085993, 132470, 30861, '<td valign="top">This feels like the china should be more white. Might benefit from 10% crop on left side, seems like a tad too much empty space there. It''s unfortunate, also, at least to my eye, that everything "in" the picture is above the vertical center. If the veggies (which are beautiful) were dropped a little more below the fork, and fork/veggies both were moved down a tad, this might be more dynamic</td>', 'This feels like the china should be more white. Might benefit from 10% crop on left side, seems like a tad too much empty space there. It''s unfortunate, also, at least to my eye, that everything "in" the picture is above the vertical center. If the veggies (which are beautiful) were dropped a little more below the fork, and fork/veggies both were moved down a tad, this might be more dynamic', '2005-01-02 00:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1085995, 132330, 30861, '<td valign="top">Simply outstanding. Might want to tone down the single, white stone in image center?</td>', 'Simply outstanding. Might want to tone down the single, white stone in image center?', '2005-01-02 00:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1085996, 132483, 30861, '<td valign="top">Terrific concept and composition. I wish there were more DOF, and perhaps a little smoke...</td>', 'Terrific concept and composition. I wish there were more DOF, and perhaps a little smoke...', '2005-01-02 00:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1085997, 132137, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is extremely nice, and would be nicer yet (at least on my monitor) if the darker fruits on the left came up half a stop or so...</td>', 'This is extremely nice, and would be nicer yet (at least on my monitor) if the darker fruits on the left came up half a stop or so...', '2005-01-02 01:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086001, 132294, 30861, '<td valign="top">very nice abstract, marred to my eyes by oversharpening.</td>', 'very nice abstract, marred to my eyes by oversharpening.', '2005-01-02 01:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086002, 132044, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  I love the depth of the colors and the border is just right.  Gorgeous symmetry.  Well done!  :o)</td>', 'This is beautiful.  I love the depth of the colors and the border is just right.  Gorgeous symmetry.  Well done!  :o)', '2005-01-02 01:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086003, 131974, 30861, '<td valign="top">Sweet... Love the hair, and the oh-so-precise overlap of tongue with lower lip.</td>', 'Sweet... Love the hair, and the oh-so-precise overlap of tongue with lower lip.', '2005-01-02 01:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086004, 132452, 30861, '<td valign="top">eerie as hell. composition seems a tad static for outside-the-box thinking.</td>', 'eerie as hell. composition seems a tad static for outside-the-box thinking.', '2005-01-02 01:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086006, 132267, 30861, '<td valign="top">Lovely to see an image "telling a story" in such a subtle way. Without the hand, a 5 or 6. With it, a definite bump up.</td>', 'Lovely to see an image "telling a story" in such a subtle way. Without the hand, a 5 or 6. With it, a definite bump up.', '2005-01-02 01:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086008, 131822, 30861, '<td valign="top">the texture of this is amazing. but do you really EAT those things? yuk....</td>', 'the texture of this is amazing. but do you really EAT those things? yuk....', '2005-01-02 01:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086010, 132229, 30861, '<td valign="top">I am surprised at how weak the cigarette shots are in this challenge. This is one of the best, but I wish the shadows weren''t so blocked up everywhere.</td>', 'I am surprised at how weak the cigarette shots are in this challenge. This is one of the best, but I wish the shadows weren''t so blocked up everywhere.', '2005-01-02 01:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086011, 132267, 15811, '<td valign="top">OMG why did you put your credit card number on the internet!!!  That being said, i like the use of DOF.  The lighting seems a bit on the low side, but the composition and sharp focus makes up for it.  The credit card owner walking out the door is a nice addition to the scene -- as if he just cut up his card and is done with it.  Good work.</td>', 'OMG why did you put your credit card number on the internet!!!  That being said, i like the use of DOF.  The lighting seems a bit on the low side, but the composition and sharp focus makes up for it.  The credit card owner walking out the door is a nice addition to the scene -- as if he just cut up his card and is done with it.  Good work.', '2005-01-02 01:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086012, 132480, 30861, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s loud and it''s off-the-wall so I guess you''re on your way...</td>', 'Well, it''s loud and it''s off-the-wall so I guess you''re on your way...', '2005-01-02 01:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086014, 132181, 30861, '<td valign="top">I love this one. I wish the area where the finger is, to the left, weren''t showing a fuzzy, pale blob...</td>', 'I love this one. I wish the area where the finger is, to the left, weren''t showing a fuzzy, pale blob...', '2005-01-02 01:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086015, 131974, 28364, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I like alot.</td>', 'Very interesting. I like alot.', '2005-01-02 01:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
