(1086018, 131770, 30861, '<td valign="top">beautiful, soft, serene tonalities support the resolution extremely well. A luscious picture at that level. I''m not sure the composition is all it could be; I''d be thinking move the leftmost saucer down a tad and in a tad, i think. And if the spoon in the leftmost saucer were rotated counterclockwise maybe 5-7% that might be a little stronger...</td>', 'beautiful, soft, serene tonalities support the resolution extremely well. A luscious picture at that level. I''m not sure the composition is all it could be; I''d be thinking move the leftmost saucer down a tad and in a tad, i think. And if the spoon in the leftmost saucer were rotated counterclockwise maybe 5-7% that might be a little stronger...', '2005-01-02 01:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086019, 132157, 29269, '<td valign="top">You want bad comments?!<br/>I''d preffer a picture with the horizont line at the lower 3rd line of the image i.e. cropped ~30% from the bottom, and then to preserve the aspect ratio, crop another 30% from the right.<br/> <br/>How''s this for a bad comment?</td>', 'You want bad comments?!I''d preffer a picture with the horizont line at the lower 3rd line of the image i.e. cropped ~30% from the bottom, and then to preserve the aspect ratio, crop another 30% from the right. How''s this for a bad comment?', '2005-01-02 01:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086020, 132090, 15811, '<td valign="top">Wow -- what a facial expression, Konador ;-)  He could be saying one of many things.  Dogs are very interesting.</td>', 'Wow -- what a facial expression, Konador ;-)  He could be saying one of many things.  Dogs are very interesting.', '2005-01-02 01:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086021, 132469, 28364, '<td valign="top">Cherish every moment of it. It''ll be gone before you know it.</td>', 'Cherish every moment of it. It''ll be gone before you know it.', '2005-01-02 01:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086022, 132231, 30861, '<td valign="top">Rich and haunting image of depression, the blue duotone (if that''s what it is) works extremely well.</td>', 'Rich and haunting image of depression, the blue duotone (if that''s what it is) works extremely well.', '2005-01-02 01:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086024, 132450, 28364, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice shot.', '2005-01-02 01:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086026, 131735, 30861, '<td valign="top">This one may be TOO sharp... Mistify it a little and the choclate would look more "dangerous"... The ble/type diagonal area is way too agressive, I think. A little desaturation there might have worked wonders.</td>', 'This one may be TOO sharp... Mistify it a little and the choclate would look more "dangerous"... The ble/type diagonal area is way too agressive, I think. A little desaturation there might have worked wonders.', '2005-01-02 01:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
