(1086042, 131899, 24846, '<td valign="top">I think he''s ready for his walk..good luck.</td>', 'I think he''s ready for his walk..good luck.', '2005-01-02 01:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086048, 132452, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great concept. Love the variance of blues, lighting, and reflective execution. I may have cropped 2/3 off top fraame. Good luck and HNY.</td>', 'Great concept. Love the variance of blues, lighting, and reflective execution. I may have cropped 2/3 off top fraame. Good luck and HNY.', '2005-01-02 01:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086050, 132424, 13749, '<td valign="top">ROFL.  10 for humor.  technically solid too, so the 10 stands!</td>', 'ROFL.  10 for humor.  technically solid too, so the 10 stands!', '2005-01-02 01:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086054, 132370, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great study of shadow. Reminds me of Alfred Hitchcock. Good luck in the challenge and the weight loss.</td>', 'Great study of shadow. Reminds me of Alfred Hitchcock. Good luck in the challenge and the weight loss.', '2005-01-02 01:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086063, 131776, 24846, '<td valign="top">Great image and resolution match. The water pulling my eyes to the reflective fence then up the posts to the shoreline is wonderfully executed. Good luck with this challenge and HNY.</td>', 'Great image and resolution match. The water pulling my eyes to the reflective fence then up the posts to the shoreline is wonderfully executed. Good luck with this challenge and HNY.', '2005-01-02 01:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086064, 132378, 13749, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I have always loved high key images like this, and I find your subject choice particularly fitting.  this guy kinda looks like he knows how to ski already, but i won''t hold that against you.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I have always loved high key images like this, and I find your subject choice particularly fitting.  this guy kinda looks like he knows how to ski already, but i won''t hold that against you.', '2005-01-02 01:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086065, 132142, 14656, '<td valign="top">Very busy shot, clearly gets the message across of being unorganized. I''d toy around with the white balance on your camera or at least try to correct the color cast in Photoshop.</td>', 'Very busy shot, clearly gets the message across of being unorganized. I''d toy around with the white balance on your camera or at least try to correct the color cast in Photoshop.', '2005-01-02 01:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086066, 132245, 22384, '<td valign="top">The selective desat works well for me. Beautiful creature, your dog. Such an animated face. Sweet shot. 10</td>', 'The selective desat works well for me. Beautiful creature, your dog. Such an animated face. Sweet shot. 10', '2005-01-02 01:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086067, 132084, 25952, '<td valign="top">love the mood of this photo. i have taken a similar shot and it is one of my favorites. Seems like it could be a bit underexposed though? otherwise i like the compostion and negative space.</td>', 'love the mood of this photo. i have taken a similar shot and it is one of my favorites. Seems like it could be a bit underexposed though? otherwise i like the compostion and negative space.', '2005-01-02 01:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086068, 132059, 25952, '<td valign="top">good use of lighting.</td>', 'good use of lighting.', '2005-01-02 01:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086069, 131776, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great concept, but i just can''t get into this fence. I want a focal point for something that grabs my attention. Wish I would have thought of the brilliant idea, though. Great brain you have.</td>', 'Great concept, but i just can''t get into this fence. I want a focal point for something that grabs my attention. Wish I would have thought of the brilliant idea, though. Great brain you have.', '2005-01-02 01:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086070, 132379, 14656, '<td valign="top">This is one of my many resolutions as well but instead of just preventing myself from doing something (which is relatively easy), I will also make an effort to do something I didn''t last year..</td>', 'This is one of my many resolutions as well but instead of just preventing myself from doing something (which is relatively easy), I will also make an effort to do something I didn''t last year..', '2005-01-02 01:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086071, 131975, 22384, '<td valign="top">Oh man, these cigarettes are just too neatly broken. I bet your life is organized and you make lists and stick to them, don''t you? I just want to reach up and mess this shot up a bit.</td>', 'Oh man, these cigarettes are just too neatly broken. I bet your life is organized and you make lists and stick to them, don''t you? I just want to reach up and mess this shot up a bit.', '2005-01-02 01:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086072, 132369, 28003, '<td valign="top">Okay. What?</td>', 'Okay. What?', '2005-01-02 01:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086073, 131975, 14656, '<td valign="top">Crop is extremely tight. Would''ve liked a little more "breathing" room, no pun intended. Focus also appears a little soft, even on the focal point. Try the unsharp mask.</td>', 'Crop is extremely tight. Would''ve liked a little more "breathing" room, no pun intended. Focus also appears a little soft, even on the focal point. Try the unsharp mask.', '2005-01-02 01:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086075, 132316, 25952, '<td valign="top">did u have the flash fire twice during the exposure? if you did i would say just rear curtain sync would be the way to go. That top foot although not as ''frozen'' as the others makes this image a bit confusing. besides that though everything looks good, i cant vote, but if i could it give it a 7.</td>', 'did u have the flash fire twice during the exposure? if you did i would say just rear curtain sync would be the way to go. That top foot although not as ''frozen'' as the others makes this image a bit confusing. besides that though everything looks good, i cant vote, but if i could it give it a 7.', '2005-01-02 01:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086076, 132274, 14656, '<td valign="top">Interesting resolution and great capture!</td>', 'Interesting resolution and great capture!', '2005-01-02 01:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086077, 132424, 25952, '<td valign="top">hahaha funny.</td>', 'hahaha funny.', '2005-01-02 01:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086079, 132059, 22384, '<td valign="top">I love this brilliant, artsy shot. Good for you, you courageous soul! It makes my heart soar to see great techinical merit and brilliant artistic composition and lighting come together. One of the very best, ever. Bravo...a 10 from me.</td>', 'I love this brilliant, artsy shot. Good for you, you courageous soul! It makes my heart soar to see great techinical merit and brilliant artistic composition and lighting come together. One of the very best, ever. Bravo...a 10 from me.', '2005-01-02 01:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
