(1086087, 132157, 25952, '<td valign="top">this is just an awesome photo, however i feel it doesn''t meet the challenge. It relies solely on the title. I cant vote, but if i could id probly give it a 6 or 7, if it fit the challenge more i could give it a 9 or even 10. I really like this shot alot, and i could see why you''d wanna submit it. I might try a bit of a different angle though, to get the horizon either in the top 3rd or bottom 3rd of the photo, depending on waht seemed more interesting, ground or sky. thats just me though.</td>', 'this is just an awesome photo, however i feel it doesn''t meet the challenge. It relies solely on the title. I cant vote, but if i could id probly give it a 6 or 7, if it fit the challenge more i could give it a 9 or even 10. I really like this shot alot, and i could see why you''d wanna submit it. I might try a bit of a different angle though, to get the horizon either in the top 3rd or bottom 3rd of the photo, depending on waht seemed more interesting, ground or sky. thats just me though.', '2005-01-02 01:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086088, 132215, 22384, '<td valign="top">I love the concept. Nice use of color and wit. ( and a how nice you have a brain, too: having the ribbons moving off the frame to the right, the future...very nice.) An easy 9 from me.</td>', 'I love the concept. Nice use of color and wit. ( and a how nice you have a brain, too: having the ribbons moving off the frame to the right, the future...very nice.) An easy 9 from me.', '2005-01-02 01:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086089, 132137, 14656, '<td valign="top">Even though the fruit is in color, my eyes are drawn to the white areas of the photo. Would''ve been nice to see the fruit better lit. It would hold my attention better.</td>', 'Even though the fruit is in color, my eyes are drawn to the white areas of the photo. Would''ve been nice to see the fruit better lit. It would hold my attention better.', '2005-01-02 01:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086092, 132434, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this shot: the technical "merit" (forgive the pun); the cropping; the hint of lipstick on the cigarette butt; the smoke; the broken cigarette in the ashtray. One of the best shots of the challenge. Excellent job!  10</td>', 'I like everything about this shot: the technical "merit" (forgive the pun); the cropping; the hint of lipstick on the cigarette butt; the smoke; the broken cigarette in the ashtray. One of the best shots of the challenge. Excellent job!  10', '2005-01-02 01:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086093, 132449, 14656, '<td valign="top">Image appears a bit overprocessed. The trees in the background (and sky) are burned a little too much and the grass in the middleground is dodged too much. Contrast is too harsh. Would''ve liked to see the stream a little closer to the center of the frame as that is the only thing my eye finds interesting.</td>', 'Image appears a bit overprocessed. The trees in the background (and sky) are burned a little too much and the grass in the middleground is dodged too much. Contrast is too harsh. Would''ve liked to see the stream a little closer to the center of the frame as that is the only thing my eye finds interesting.', '2005-01-02 01:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086095, 132381, 14656, '<td valign="top">The tangled branches of the middleground is quite busy but I think it adds ot the photo. Would''ve liked to see the leaf a bit brighter, perhaps by dodging it. The whites shining through the branches are what I find distracting.</td>', 'The tangled branches of the middleground is quite busy but I think it adds ot the photo. Would''ve liked to see the leaf a bit brighter, perhaps by dodging it. The whites shining through the branches are what I find distracting.', '2005-01-02 02:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
