(1086102, 132305, 14656, '<td valign="top">I think the multiple light sources casting different shadows on the background a bit distracting. Skin also has the appearance of over NeatImaging. Perhaps having a single light source and standing much farther from your background would take care of the shadow problems.</td>', 'I think the multiple light sources casting different shadows on the background a bit distracting. Skin also has the appearance of over NeatImaging. Perhaps having a single light source and standing much farther from your background would take care of the shadow problems.', '2005-01-02 02:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
