(1086105, 132018, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice crop and composition. Image needs more highlights, this is basically midtones and shadows. Shadow on the right side of the frame adds even more to the "dark" feeling. This is the type of image that needs to be light and upbeat. High key would''ve worked well here. This feels dark, gloomy, and depressing.</td>', 'Nice crop and composition. Image needs more highlights, this is basically midtones and shadows. Shadow on the right side of the frame adds even more to the "dark" feeling. This is the type of image that needs to be light and upbeat. High key would''ve worked well here. This feels dark, gloomy, and depressing.', '2005-01-02 02:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086106, 132230, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. Having a hard time finding the focal point of your photo as nothing seems in sharp focus. Wine glass in immediate foreground but out of focus heavily distracting.</td>', 'Nice colors. Having a hard time finding the focal point of your photo as nothing seems in sharp focus. Wine glass in immediate foreground but out of focus heavily distracting.', '2005-01-02 02:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
