(1086184, 131958, 7438, '<td valign="top">Very smooth -- adding a bunch of blank space above would be interesting I think, as if the current photo was only the bottom 1/3 or so. Just a thought</td>', 'Very smooth -- adding a bunch of blank space above would be interesting I think, as if the current photo was only the bottom 1/3 or so. Just a thought', '2005-01-02 02:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
