(1086195, 132127, 7438, '<td valign="top">I like it, the light and color tones are nice -- the composition works really well too, although placing the view between the hills a bit higher in the frame would make the whole thing more dynamic I think</td>', 'I like it, the light and color tones are nice -- the composition works really well too, although placing the view between the hills a bit higher in the frame would make the whole thing more dynamic I think', '2005-01-02 03:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
