(1086238, 132090, 13749, '<td valign="top">i think i recognize this dog and shot.  great work ben.  next time tell him to get that hair out of his eyes!  haha, jk.  beautiful expression, you really captured the moment here - i can just imagine him begging for a walk right now.</td>', 'i think i recognize this dog and shot.  great work ben.  next time tell him to get that hair out of his eyes!  haha, jk.  beautiful expression, you really captured the moment here - i can just imagine him begging for a walk right now.', '2005-01-02 03:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086239, 132299, 7438, '<td valign="top">It looks very artificial -- made out of two different photos and some background textures?</td>', 'It looks very artificial -- made out of two different photos and some background textures?', '2005-01-02 03:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086241, 131736, 13749, '<td valign="top">hey me too.. well, the one on the screen anyways - i prefer EP/PP though.. they seem to have the worst players out of anywhere that i''ve tried.  glad you took this when you weren''t actually involved in a hand!</td>', 'hey me too.. well, the one on the screen anyways - i prefer EP/PP though.. they seem to have the worst players out of anywhere that i''ve tried.  glad you took this when you weren''t actually involved in a hand!', '2005-01-02 03:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086242, 132299, 13749, '<td valign="top">i hope that''s not really alcohol!! you could''ve given it to a poor college student! haha, jk.  bowl kinda looking like it''s floating, but don''t hold that against you - just an observation.</td>', 'i hope that''s not really alcohol!! you could''ve given it to a poor college student! haha, jk.  bowl kinda looking like it''s floating, but don''t hold that against you - just an observation.', '2005-01-02 03:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086243, 132090, 7438, '<td valign="top">Aww. Nice doggy picture, very good use of shallow DOF -- I must say the poor thing looks more stuffed than alive though, for some reason.</td>', 'Aww. Nice doggy picture, very good use of shallow DOF -- I must say the poor thing looks more stuffed than alive though, for some reason.', '2005-01-02 03:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086244, 132379, 13749, '<td valign="top">great shot - i love the up close focus and short dof.. good resolution, i hope you keep it!</td>', 'great shot - i love the up close focus and short dof.. good resolution, i hope you keep it!', '2005-01-02 03:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086245, 132447, 22011, '<td valign="top">Wow...  Not so much the photo, but the concept of land-yatching on ice.....    That''s gotta be a huge rush.<br/> <br/>Oh, and I like the photo as well, I think you''ve chosen a good crop, and you''ve done well in poor light.  A bit more contrast would be nice, but you would have had to adjust the exposure in camera, not in PS/GIMP to do that without making it obvious.  (+2/3rds of a stop compensation...)  <br/> <br/>7</td>', 'Wow...  Not so much the photo, but the concept of land-yatching on ice.....    That''s gotta be a huge rush. Oh, and I like the photo as well, I think you''ve chosen a good crop, and you''ve done well in poor light.  A bit more contrast would be nice, but you would have had to adjust the exposure in camera, not in PS/GIMP to do that without making it obvious.  (+2/3rds of a stop compensation...)   7', '2005-01-02 03:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086246, 132447, 13749, '<td valign="top">too bad it was overcast this day (is that ice it''s sitting on?  wow) - some color and light in the sky would''ve done this otherwise great shot some justice.</td>', 'too bad it was overcast this day (is that ice it''s sitting on?  wow) - some color and light in the sky would''ve done this otherwise great shot some justice.', '2005-01-02 03:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086247, 132256, 22011, '<td valign="top">What''s with the odd glasses?  They really ruin a nice pic, for me anyway..</td>', 'What''s with the odd glasses?  They really ruin a nice pic, for me anyway..', '2005-01-02 03:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086248, 132394, 22011, '<td valign="top">That''s 104 photos, I hope you''ve got lots of wall space! :-).</td>', 'That''s 104 photos, I hope you''ve got lots of wall space! :-).', '2005-01-02 03:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086249, 132021, 24982, '<td valign="top">Probably would have been better without the watch and the big dark spot in the middle of the shoe. But I do like the black/white</td>', 'Probably would have been better without the watch and the big dark spot in the middle of the shoe. But I do like the black/white', '2005-01-02 03:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086251, 131762, 10658, '<td valign="top">Wow...now there''s some eye candy, but it''s difficult to relate the photo to the challenge without the title.  Still, I think it''s a great photo (really really nice to look at) so I''ll give you an 8</td>', 'Wow...now there''s some eye candy, but it''s difficult to relate the photo to the challenge without the title.  Still, I think it''s a great photo (really really nice to look at) so I''ll give you an 8', '2005-01-02 03:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086255, 132267, 7438, '<td valign="top">Me likes -- very good use of selective desaturation, the man in the background adds alot of depth and the composition is spot on</td>', 'Me likes -- very good use of selective desaturation, the man in the background adds alot of depth and the composition is spot on', '2005-01-02 03:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086257, 132467, 24982, '<td valign="top">please tell me you didn''t actually shred money... Cool shot.</td>', 'please tell me you didn''t actually shred money... Cool shot.', '2005-01-02 04:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086258, 132181, 16241, '<td valign="top">lovely foto :)</td>', 'lovely foto :)', '2005-01-02 04:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
