(1086263, 132015, 10658, '<td valign="top">It took me a minute to get it, but now that I''ve got it I like it :)  I''m gonna bump off a point because without the title I''d have never gotten it so you''re getting a 9</td>', 'It took me a minute to get it, but now that I''ve got it I like it :)  I''m gonna bump off a point because without the title I''d have never gotten it so you''re getting a 9', '2005-01-02 04:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
