(1086272, 132466, 31307, '<td valign="top">Nice Camera--no no: I mean the one that took this picture.  It''s JUST like the one I use*...come to think of it, that calender looks familiar, too...<br/> <br/>On the serious side:<br/>I noticed that you took the color out of the shot.  That was a good choice considering, one, there wasn''t that much color there in the first place, and, two, adding color to the elements in the shot wouldn''t do anything to make them more interesting.<br/> <br/>*For those unaware: he used my camera to take the shot, but not my person.  I''m just teasing him and not trying to say the shot''s illegal, because it''s not.</td>', 'Nice Camera--no no: I mean the one that took this picture.  It''s JUST like the one I use*...come to think of it, that calender looks familiar, too... On the serious side:I noticed that you took the color out of the shot.  That was a good choice considering, one, there wasn''t that much color there in the first place, and, two, adding color to the elements in the shot wouldn''t do anything to make them more interesting. *For those unaware: he used my camera to take the shot, but not my person.  I''m just teasing him and not trying to say the shot''s illegal, because it''s not.', '2005-01-02 04:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086274, 131947, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent, I love the colors.</td>', 'Excellent, I love the colors.', '2005-01-02 04:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086275, 132327, 23458, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. The lighting on the face is a little harsh, but I like his expression - it''s a very warm and loving photo.</td>', 'Interesting composition. The lighting on the face is a little harsh, but I like his expression - it''s a very warm and loving photo.', '2005-01-02 04:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086276, 131947, 23458, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I really don''t know what to do with this one, so I''ll give you a stream of conscious monologue while I consider it. My first thought was that the border is awful. and no further consideration will change that. I tend not to subtract marks for dreadful borders (this one just appears cheesy) so we''ll just move on to the image. The composition here is great, the setting is beautiful and I love the misty feel. Overall you have created a beautiful mood with this shot. So congratulations on that level.  Now the difficulty arises here in respect of the challenge. Sure, to spend more time with family is an admirable resolution, but Im not sure that this image evokes that for me. This does a wonderful job of conveying the peacefulness of the early morning ride, but I just don''t feel that this conveys an individual''s resolve to spend more time with their family. This is far too good an image to hammer with a low score, but I can''t go higher than five here. <br/> <br/>Anyway, to end this on a good note, this is a beautiful image, one you should be proud of. Best of luck with this challenge and future ones.</td>', 'Hmmm, I really don''t know what to do with this one, so I''ll give you a stream of conscious monologue while I consider it. My first thought was that the border is awful. and no further consideration will change that. I tend not to subtract marks for dreadful borders (this one just appears cheesy) so we''ll just move on to the image. The composition here is great, the setting is beautiful and I love the misty feel. Overall you have created a beautiful mood with this shot. So congratulations on that level.  Now the difficulty arises here in respect of the challenge. Sure, to spend more time with family is an admirable resolution, but Im not sure that this image evokes that for me. This does a wonderful job of conveying the peacefulness of the early morning ride, but I just don''t feel that this conveys an individual''s resolve to spend more time with their family. This is far too good an image to hammer with a low score, but I can''t go higher than five here.  Anyway, to end this on a good note, this is a beautiful image, one you should be proud of. Best of luck with this challenge and future ones.', '2005-01-02 04:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
