(1086319, 132364, 23458, '<td valign="top">Okay this image is both amusing and outrageously well executed. That earns you a 10 from me and a blue ribbon prediction. (please note, the only other time I ever predicted an image would win the challenge it did- see comment on imagineers landmark entry - so congratulations in advance :P). <br/> <br/>Revised comment - having seen the other images I''m afraid I''m going to have to downgrade my projection to top 5 :).... partly because of a couple of incredible shots. But mainly because someone else took exactly the same photo - which will likely kill your originality vote. Still, a ten from me. great composition and lighting. <br/> <br/>PS... I reserve the right to change my prediction once I have voted on the entire field - this is about the 12th photo I have seen.</td>', 'Okay this image is both amusing and outrageously well executed. That earns you a 10 from me and a blue ribbon prediction. (please note, the only other time I ever predicted an image would win the challenge it did- see comment on imagineers landmark entry - so congratulations in advance :P).  Revised comment - having seen the other images I''m afraid I''m going to have to downgrade my projection to top 5 :).... partly because of a couple of incredible shots. But mainly because someone else took exactly the same photo - which will likely kill your originality vote. Still, a ten from me. great composition and lighting.  PS... I reserve the right to change my prediction once I have voted on the entire field - this is about the 12th photo I have seen.', '2005-01-02 04:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
