(1087855, 132461, 24846, '<td valign="top">Wow. Like this alot. Like the center line pulling me right down and to the horizon. Good luck and HNY.</td>', 'Wow. Like this alot. Like the center line pulling me right down and to the horizon. Good luck and HNY.', '2005-01-02 23:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087859, 131883, 24846, '<td valign="top">Lol. A unique holiday gift I imagine. Good luck with this vivid and humorous take on our obsessions...HNY</td>', 'Lol. A unique holiday gift I imagine. Good luck with this vivid and humorous take on our obsessions...HNY', '2005-01-02 23:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087861, 132220, 24846, '<td valign="top">Careful how you spend it...Good luck and HNY</td>', 'Careful how you spend it...Good luck and HNY', '2005-01-02 23:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087866, 132127, 24846, '<td valign="top">...and the ribbon goes to... Thanks for this great shot I can look at. Good luck and HNY.</td>', '...and the ribbon goes to... Thanks for this great shot I can look at. Good luck and HNY.', '2005-01-02 23:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087869, 131975, 13749, '<td valign="top">creative take.. - if this really is your resolution, i wish you the best of luck to a healthier 2005 :)</td>', 'creative take.. - if this really is your resolution, i wish you the best of luck to a healthier 2005 :)', '2005-01-02 23:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087874, 132466, 13749, '<td valign="top">that looks just like my old camera! i even had the same filter!  good thing i sold it, or i''d be worried that you took it!  anyway, nice shot - the shadw certainly adds some depth.  perhaps a fill light would have removed the harshness slightly, but no biggie.  good luck on this resolution for a PaD''05!</td>', 'that looks just like my old camera! i even had the same filter!  good thing i sold it, or i''d be worried that you took it!  anyway, nice shot - the shadw certainly adds some depth.  perhaps a fill light would have removed the harshness slightly, but no biggie.  good luck on this resolution for a PaD''05!', '2005-01-02 23:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087877, 131822, 13749, '<td valign="top">whatever they are, they sure don''t look good for you!  some sort of candy, i''m sure.  anyway, i like your choice of colors.. all very vibrant and bright.. well balanced, not to the point that it looks unnatural.</td>', 'whatever they are, they sure don''t look good for you!  some sort of candy, i''m sure.  anyway, i like your choice of colors.. all very vibrant and bright.. well balanced, not to the point that it looks unnatural.', '2005-01-02 23:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087882, 132231, 13749, '<td valign="top">she still looks kinda depressed - i hope you took this on dec31 and not jan1 ;)<br/> <br/>very expressive style of image.. all the burning really helps bring out focus to the left.  great choice of location, as well.</td>', 'she still looks kinda depressed - i hope you took this on dec31 and not jan1 ;) very expressive style of image.. all the burning really helps bring out focus to the left.  great choice of location, as well.', '2005-01-02 23:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087885, 132316, 13749, '<td valign="top">good idea - i would''ve perhaps liked the legs to have been in a full motion blur, since the more solid bottom positions and the slightly apparent top position just tend to point out that you stopped pedaling for a little while at the bottom (otherwise they wouldn''t be this solidly rendered.. unless you used a flash, i suppose).  anyway, good idea and good luck on your resolution!</td>', 'good idea - i would''ve perhaps liked the legs to have been in a full motion blur, since the more solid bottom positions and the slightly apparent top position just tend to point out that you stopped pedaling for a little while at the bottom (otherwise they wouldn''t be this solidly rendered.. unless you used a flash, i suppose).  anyway, good idea and good luck on your resolution!', '2005-01-02 23:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
