(1088534, 131770, 24846, '<td valign="top">Love the earthy tones, great swirls in the latte. Like the triangular arrangement and crop. Enjoy everything in moderation. Good luck and HNY.</td>', 'Love the earthy tones, great swirls in the latte. Like the triangular arrangement and crop. Enjoy everything in moderation. Good luck and HNY.', '2005-01-03 10:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
