(1088547, 132231, 24846, '<td valign="top">This is a very appealing image. The colors &amp; dof (boken)  easily pull me to the subject.For me this has a more hopeful than depresive quality. Great job on this most interesting submisson. Good luck and cheer up this new year. ;-)</td>', 'This is a very appealing image. The colors & dof (boken)  easily pull me to the subject.For me this has a more hopeful than depresive quality. Great job on this most interesting submisson. Good luck and cheer up this new year. ;-)', '2005-01-03 10:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088552, 132157, 24846, '<td valign="top">Very neat colors. The forefront really pulls you in. The crop is perfect.Good luck and HNY</td>', 'Very neat colors. The forefront really pulls you in. The crop is perfect.Good luck and HNY', '2005-01-03 10:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088564, 132059, 24846, '<td valign="top">Like the slight edge of light on your right side of head.With my limited lighting knowledge I can''t make a good how to suggestion, but I would prefer the image with less glare on the far left of yor head&amp;face. The symbolism is good with 1/2 in out of the light. I like this portrait, but wonder what effect if your left eye was in view with a "looking" for it effect. Nice work, good luck and HNY.</td>', 'Like the slight edge of light on your right side of head.With my limited lighting knowledge I can''t make a good how to suggestion, but I would prefer the image with less glare on the far left of yor head&face. The symbolism is good with 1/2 in out of the light. I like this portrait, but wonder what effect if your left eye was in view with a "looking" for it effect. Nice work, good luck and HNY.', '2005-01-03 10:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
