(1089523, 132127, 17507, '<td valign="top">it really is important to strike a balance between taking in a scene and taking a picture of it. sometimes i think it''s better to go out without a camera so that i actually remember to look at what''s in front of me, instead of pulling out the camera, shooting it, and then feeling like i''ve accomplished my business there.<br/> <br/>great photo, great title. 9.</td>', 'it really is important to strike a balance between taking in a scene and taking a picture of it. sometimes i think it''s better to go out without a camera so that i actually remember to look at what''s in front of me, instead of pulling out the camera, shooting it, and then feeling like i''ve accomplished my business there. great photo, great title. 9.', '2005-01-03 19:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
