(1091400, 132127, 23458, '<td valign="top">This image is incredibly pleasing. Beautiful scene and excellent post-processing. On one level this image is positively serene - but then the post processing throws that a little off kilter - challenges the serenity if you will, which makes for a really dramatic and effective landscape shot. I''m almost certain of the photographer here - Let''s just say that if voters are a little flexible with the challenge you should have even more green on your profile page after this. (Of course that statement is to be ignored if you are not in fact Ed Clarke or e301).</td>', 'This image is incredibly pleasing. Beautiful scene and excellent post-processing. On one level this image is positively serene - but then the post processing throws that a little off kilter - challenges the serenity if you will, which makes for a really dramatic and effective landscape shot. I''m almost certain of the photographer here - Let''s just say that if voters are a little flexible with the challenge you should have even more green on your profile page after this. (Of course that statement is to be ignored if you are not in fact Ed Clarke or e301).', '2005-01-04 21:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091408, 132316, 23458, '<td valign="top">Really nice execution here - love the contrast between the true-colour legs and the blue cast bicycle. My only qualm is that the shoes don''t look particularly athletic :)... but we can''t exactly expect you to go out and buy a new pair now can we. 8.</td>', 'Really nice execution here - love the contrast between the true-colour legs and the blue cast bicycle. My only qualm is that the shoes don''t look particularly athletic :)... but we can''t exactly expect you to go out and buy a new pair now can we. 8.', '2005-01-04 21:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091410, 131974, 23458, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and execution. The soft focus/ high key effect is terrific here. I''d say the subject matter will likely keep you out of ribbon territory, but your technical skill is tremendous. 8.</td>', 'Interesting idea and execution. The soft focus/ high key effect is terrific here. I''d say the subject matter will likely keep you out of ribbon territory, but your technical skill is tremendous. 8.', '2005-01-04 21:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
