(1093307, 132369, 30861, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to see the backstory on this one, LOL. The neck section lower left comes across as a chin bulge when it is combined with the skull, and this is a flaw for me. The clothing appears to be Camo, even if it''s just shadows, and that''s a bit chilling. All in all it''s eerie, and well done.</td>', 'I can''t wait to see the backstory on this one, LOL. The neck section lower left comes across as a chin bulge when it is combined with the skull, and this is a flaw for me. The clothing appears to be Camo, even if it''s just shadows, and that''s a bit chilling. All in all it''s eerie, and well done.', '2005-01-05 16:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093308, 132412, 27574, '<td valign="top">I love it, nice tones, contrast and lighting</td>', 'I love it, nice tones, contrast and lighting', '2005-01-05 16:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
