(1093311, 131950, 30861, '<td valign="top">High points for honesty, LOL. Let us drink life to the lees? Robinson Jeffers had in a poem "Even in the bitter less and sediment, new discovery may lie." This grows on me. I hadn''t ranked it especially high in my first pass through, and I am bumping it up.</td>', 'High points for honesty, LOL. Let us drink life to the lees? Robinson Jeffers had in a poem "Even in the bitter less and sediment, new discovery may lie." This grows on me. I hadn''t ranked it especially high in my first pass through, and I am bumping it up.', '2005-01-05 16:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093314, 131770, 27574, '<td valign="top">Yum, you did a lovely job on the lighting and tones</td>', 'Yum, you did a lovely job on the lighting and tones', '2005-01-05 16:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093316, 132288, 30861, '<td valign="top">It "feels" to me like this was just an excuse to get a flower shot in, LOL. It''s a hell of a nice flower shot and and I am scoring it well, butr I''d score it higher if it were somehow more tight to the challenge topic.</td>', 'It "feels" to me like this was just an excuse to get a flower shot in, LOL. It''s a hell of a nice flower shot and and I am scoring it well, butr I''d score it higher if it were somehow more tight to the challenge topic.', '2005-01-05 16:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093317, 131828, 27574, '<td valign="top">I think you should choose the blue one!  Oops, just noticed the orange one....that one is more important.</td>', 'I think you should choose the blue one!  Oops, just noticed the orange one....that one is more important.', '2005-01-05 16:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093318, 132469, 30861, '<td valign="top">A good resolution. Funny to see a candid sneak in here, LOL. The bit of arm showing under the sleeve lower left is an eyetrap for me The whole photo is a tad centered, as well. I find that if I crop in from the left so that sleeve is eliminated, the image is much more focused, we draw down ,ore easily to where the eyes are looking.</td>', 'A good resolution. Funny to see a candid sneak in here, LOL. The bit of arm showing under the sleeve lower left is an eyetrap for me The whole photo is a tad centered, as well. I find that if I crop in from the left so that sleeve is eliminated, the image is much more focused, we draw down ,ore easily to where the eyes are looking.', '2005-01-05 16:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093319, 132063, 30861, '<td valign="top">A strong &amp; original photo, but it would be a LOT stronger if we could see a bit more china nd nose beneath the hat, I think.</td>', 'A strong & original photo, but it would be a LOT stronger if we could see a bit more china nd nose beneath the hat, I think.', '2005-01-05 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093322, 132275, 30861, '<td valign="top">Damn, that hurts! The extreme indentatiuon on the finger gives this considrable immediacy. The light "raking" the trap''s surface is lovely. The blocked-out curve of the thumb comes across as sloppy, not well-considered. The Faux resolution is amusing, as is the concept.</td>', 'Damn, that hurts! The extreme indentatiuon on the finger gives this considrable immediacy. The light "raking" the trap''s surface is lovely. The blocked-out curve of the thumb comes across as sloppy, not well-considered. The Faux resolution is amusing, as is the concept.', '2005-01-05 16:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093328, 132288, 27574, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and colors....I kept looking trying to figure out if they were fresh flowers or silk.</td>', 'Lovely composition and colors....I kept looking trying to figure out if they were fresh flowers or silk.', '2005-01-05 16:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093330, 132283, 30861, '<td valign="top">I find thisimage much stronger if it''s cropped down from the top to eliminate all sky above the bar, and all trace of the horizontal bar to which the chains attach. The face is wonderful, the sharpness and tonalities are excellent. A solid entry.</td>', 'I find thisimage much stronger if it''s cropped down from the top to eliminate all sky above the bar, and all trace of the horizontal bar to which the chains attach. The face is wonderful, the sharpness and tonalities are excellent. A solid entry.', '2005-01-05 16:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093394, 132364, 27137, '<td valign="top">i like this one, the best of the cig.</td>', 'i like this one, the best of the cig.', '2005-01-05 16:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093396, 132127, 27137, '<td valign="top">good picture, but the topic does not fit</td>', 'good picture, but the topic does not fit', '2005-01-05 16:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093484, 132245, 27293, '<td valign="top">Don''t think selective desaturation works here, makes it too cheesy. Otherwise it''s a very good shot of a pretty smart looking dog. The only thing i would add is a little more space on the right and on top.</td>', 'Don''t think selective desaturation works here, makes it too cheesy. Otherwise it''s a very good shot of a pretty smart looking dog. The only thing i would add is a little more space on the right and on top.', '2005-01-05 18:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093488, 132364, 27293, '<td valign="top">This is the best ''kick the smokes'' shot. Maybe i would add a little more space on the left. Btw, if you don''t want the smokes, send them my way =)</td>', 'This is the best ''kick the smokes'' shot. Maybe i would add a little more space on the left. Btw, if you don''t want the smokes, send them my way =)', '2005-01-05 18:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093497, 132231, 27293, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but i wouldn''t think of depression had i not seen the title... Composition-wise, i would move the camera slightly to the left. The lady should be the center [not literally in the center] of the composition, and she is not.</td>', 'Nice picture, but i wouldn''t think of depression had i not seen the title... Composition-wise, i would move the camera slightly to the left. The lady should be the center [not literally in the center] of the composition, and she is not.', '2005-01-05 18:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093504, 132447, 27293, '<td valign="top">Imo, a horizontal shot would be e alot more dynamic here, speaking of setting sails that is important. As it is, it''s a good quality picture, but it''s more of a portrait of a boat, rather than something conveying energy and thrill of new things.</td>', 'Imo, a horizontal shot would be e alot more dynamic here, speaking of setting sails that is important. As it is, it''s a good quality picture, but it''s more of a portrait of a boat, rather than something conveying energy and thrill of new things.', '2005-01-05 18:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
