(1093517, 131899, 27293, '<td valign="top">Although very much a cliche, it''s a nice portrait, one of my favorite kinds of dogs. You might want to try again, making sure the focus is on the eyes, not between the eyes and the tip of the nose.</td>', 'Although very much a cliche, it''s a nice portrait, one of my favorite kinds of dogs. You might want to try again, making sure the focus is on the eyes, not between the eyes and the tip of the nose.', '2005-01-05 18:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093521, 131974, 27293, '<td valign="top">I love everything except for the pill... I understand that''s what the photo is about, but it stands out, perhaps it should have been a different color? Would be curious to see the whole portrait in this execution style.</td>', 'I love everything except for the pill... I understand that''s what the photo is about, but it stands out, perhaps it should have been a different color? Would be curious to see the whole portrait in this execution style.', '2005-01-05 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
