(1093853, 132220, 4793, '<td valign="top">N-n-n-o, no not this way, go get a job, Nice photo....</td>', 'N-n-n-o, no not this way, go get a job, Nice photo....', '2005-01-05 21:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093861, 132199, 4793, '<td valign="top">Composition: Good<br/>Color: wonderful<br/>Nice work</td>', 'Composition: GoodColor: wonderfulNice work', '2005-01-05 21:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093871, 131770, 4793, '<td valign="top">Excellent work, beautiful colors and composition. my favorite</td>', 'Excellent work, beautiful colors and composition. my favorite', '2005-01-05 21:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093886, 132055, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and composition. Excellent</td>', 'Beautiful colors and composition. Excellent', '2005-01-05 21:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093942, 131911, 16829, '<td valign="top">A little over sharpened on the bristles, gives it a fake look. And the blown out lighting masks what might be a visually interesting juncture of the bristles with the paint.</td>', 'A little over sharpened on the bristles, gives it a fake look. And the blown out lighting masks what might be a visually interesting juncture of the bristles with the paint.', '2005-01-05 22:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1093954, 131947, 30552, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting and soft look in this photo.<br/>At first I thought it would look better if the horses were on the left side giving them room in the direction they were moving.<br/>But after looking at it a bit longer I think it''s best just the way you have it.<br/>Very nice, it''s getting a 9 from me.</td>', 'I really like the lighting and soft look in this photo.At first I thought it would look better if the horses were on the left side giving them room in the direction they were moving.But after looking at it a bit longer I think it''s best just the way you have it.Very nice, it''s getting a 9 from me.', '2005-01-05 22:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094100, 131810, 11895, '<td valign="top">looks good, I''ll take your seat at the table, pass the biscuits please<br/> <br/></td>', 'looks good, I''ll take your seat at the table, pass the biscuits please ', '2005-01-06 00:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094108, 132299, 30457, '<td valign="top">Has impact. Very strong image.</td>', 'Has impact. Very strong image.', '2005-01-06 00:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094117, 132296, 30457, '<td valign="top">I love the imagery. I have twin girls and they are constantly asking me to read to them. sometimes there isn''t enough of me to go around. -DDYJR</td>', 'I love the imagery. I have twin girls and they are constantly asking me to read to them. sometimes there isn''t enough of me to go around. -DDYJR', '2005-01-06 00:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094149, 132215, 5112, '<td valign="top">only 3?</td>', 'only 3?', '2005-01-06 01:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094153, 132469, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like this picture!  Hope you do well in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this picture!  Hope you do well in the challenge.', '2005-01-06 01:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094233, 132244, 22970, '<td valign="top">A good natural shot that depicts a new years resolution for millions. However the bright light behind take away from your picture. It distorts the arms and torso. The purple hue around the hands is very distracting and your composition leads my eyes off the bottom of the picture instead of locking them on your midsection where the subject is looking. I think if this picture would of been taken from a different POV it would of been better.  I''m not a fan of blowout highlights and that takes up the majority of the picture. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A good natural shot that depicts a new years resolution for millions. However the bright light behind take away from your picture. It distorts the arms and torso. The purple hue around the hands is very distracting and your composition leads my eyes off the bottom of the picture instead of locking them on your midsection where the subject is looking. I think if this picture would of been taken from a different POV it would of been better.  I''m not a fan of blowout highlights and that takes up the majority of the picture. Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-01-06 04:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094238, 132203, 22970, '<td valign="top">You photograph does not really tell me why your resolution is to take them out everyday. Because of odor? Because you want to walk, jog, or run everyday? I think you could of added another element to your photograph that would of let it speak for it''s self. I am distracted by the light on the bottom of the right shoe [left in picture]. It draws my eyes there, not to the main shoe or shoes, very uneven. Wish you well in the challenge.</td>', 'You photograph does not really tell me why your resolution is to take them out everyday. Because of odor? Because you want to walk, jog, or run everyday? I think you could of added another element to your photograph that would of let it speak for it''s self. I am distracted by the light on the bottom of the right shoe [left in picture]. It draws my eyes there, not to the main shoe or shoes, very uneven. Wish you well in the challenge.', '2005-01-06 04:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094242, 132221, 22970, '<td valign="top">I like your unique approach to the challenge. It is very creative. Have you ever played the game where you have a picture or two and you have to guess what it means? Well you picture is kind of like that because it stands on it''s own and that is very important. Without title or challenge it would not be hard to guess what the meaning of this photograph is. Technically you did a great job. I just wish the fire on the left was not as blown out. The fire on the right is great. I would have to say this is one of the best pictures in this challenge I have came across. Keep up the good work and best of luck in the challenge. SDW</td>', 'I like your unique approach to the challenge. It is very creative. Have you ever played the game where you have a picture or two and you have to guess what it means? Well you picture is kind of like that because it stands on it''s own and that is very important. Without title or challenge it would not be hard to guess what the meaning of this photograph is. Technically you did a great job. I just wish the fire on the left was not as blown out. The fire on the right is great. I would have to say this is one of the best pictures in this challenge I have came across. Keep up the good work and best of luck in the challenge. SDW', '2005-01-06 04:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
