(1094315, 132231, 19408, '<td valign="top">The calibre of the picture itself obviously is high. though for me, if i look at it without the title, the connection to the challenge, while still there, is more elusive. the "Not" part of the title is much less evident in the photo itself. 8. 10 if I felt a clearer photographic connection to the challenge.  Very good work, as always. my only real complaint is that you don''t submit more often! I can''t get tired of looking at these.</td>', 'The calibre of the picture itself obviously is high. though for me, if i look at it without the title, the connection to the challenge, while still there, is more elusive. the "Not" part of the title is much less evident in the photo itself. 8. 10 if I felt a clearer photographic connection to the challenge.  Very good work, as always. my only real complaint is that you don''t submit more often! I can''t get tired of looking at these.', '2005-01-06 07:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
