(1094892, 132231, 3032, '<td valign="top">This photo is so complete. Everything seems to work together. The cold toning, the mess in the background, the clothes of the subject, the pose,  the look on the face and the color toning. Yes, it breathes depression.<br/>Excellent job, one of two 10''s in this challenge.</td>', 'This photo is so complete. Everything seems to work together. The cold toning, the mess in the background, the clothes of the subject, the pose,  the look on the face and the color toning. Yes, it breathes depression.Excellent job, one of two 10''s in this challenge.', '2005-01-06 16:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094899, 132015, 3032, '<td valign="top">What a great idea, good eye!<br/>I''m also intrigued by the question what the object in the middle is. Am I looking at something huge or something relatively small? And it has this grate zigzag pattern. 9</td>', 'What a great idea, good eye!I''m also intrigued by the question what the object in the middle is. Am I looking at something huge or something relatively small? And it has this grate zigzag pattern. 9', '2005-01-06 16:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094906, 132073, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good composition and excellent B&amp;W conversion. The exposure is spot on and there are some interesting lines and light balance to help the eye around the frame. Good to have those clouds in, because it adds some interest to the sky. The only negative is that I can''t decide if my eye wants to rest at the building on the riverside or the church on top. For a travel photograph it is very good. 9</td>', 'Good composition and excellent B&W conversion. The exposure is spot on and there are some interesting lines and light balance to help the eye around the frame. Good to have those clouds in, because it adds some interest to the sky. The only negative is that I can''t decide if my eye wants to rest at the building on the riverside or the church on top. For a travel photograph it is very good. 9', '2005-01-06 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094913, 132378, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice work.<br/>There is just enough detail on the right to show what kind of slope there is. That all other detail is blown away (or replaced with a very mild gray) works great. It creates space and the tiny figure gives a good scale to that space. I like the toning. 8</td>', 'Nice work.There is just enough detail on the right to show what kind of slope there is. That all other detail is blown away (or replaced with a very mild gray) works great. It creates space and the tiny figure gives a good scale to that space. I like the toning. 8', '2005-01-06 16:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094916, 132127, 3032, '<td valign="top">Hmm, mine is the reverse: Stop looking, start shooting. :)<br/> <br/>I like the dark mood and how the stream and sides of the hills leads me down. The clouds in the sky are not of a very interesting nature, I don''t like it how they look. The orange and green colors of the foliage however look quite interesting. 8</td>', 'Hmm, mine is the reverse: Stop looking, start shooting. :) I like the dark mood and how the stream and sides of the hills leads me down. The clouds in the sky are not of a very interesting nature, I don''t like it how they look. The orange and green colors of the foliage however look quite interesting. 8', '2005-01-06 16:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094920, 131762, 3032, '<td valign="top">His face looks to smooth to make him look really nasty, on the other hand the guy from ''Cruel Intentions'' looked babyface but was nasty. So what the heck, sod it, you should be nicer dude!<br/> <br/>I like it how the light falls on the face and how the balance is between the lit side and the shadow side. In this setting the frontal portraiture works very well. The smoke or fog makes it look very interesting.</td>', 'His face looks to smooth to make him look really nasty, on the other hand the guy from ''Cruel Intentions'' looked babyface but was nasty. So what the heck, sod it, you should be nicer dude! I like it how the light falls on the face and how the balance is between the lit side and the shadow side. In this setting the frontal portraiture works very well. The smoke or fog makes it look very interesting.', '2005-01-06 16:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1094923, 132157, 3032, '<td valign="top">This looks great, I don''t like the blue tone but nevertheless the composition is quite good.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This looks great, I don''t like the blue tone but nevertheless the composition is quite good. ', '2005-01-06 16:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095006, 132090, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well Mr Konador, this is one of the better Dog pictures I have ever seen. Seems like you just happened to take this shot, and decided to throw it into the challenge, rather than actually taking the shot specifically for the challenge. To combat that you probably should have shown the dog in such a way as to imply you were doing something with him - i.e walking him. Of course a shot like that would be almost impossible to make as aesthically pleasing as the above shot. Considering, then all this could be said for any number of the images in this challenge, I''m not going to hold that against you. 9.</td>', 'Well Mr Konador, this is one of the better Dog pictures I have ever seen. Seems like you just happened to take this shot, and decided to throw it into the challenge, rather than actually taking the shot specifically for the challenge. To combat that you probably should have shown the dog in such a way as to imply you were doing something with him - i.e walking him. Of course a shot like that would be almost impossible to make as aesthically pleasing as the above shot. Considering, then all this could be said for any number of the images in this challenge, I''m not going to hold that against you. 9.', '2005-01-06 18:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095010, 132181, 23458, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, the lighting is terrific - love the effect to the right of the figure (whatever the heck that is (looks almost like a motion blur/a zoom effect - which is tremendously effective here). I would like the focus on the face to be a little crisper but besides that this is great. 8.</td>', 'I like this a lot, the lighting is terrific - love the effect to the right of the figure (whatever the heck that is (looks almost like a motion blur/a zoom effect - which is tremendously effective here). I would like the focus on the face to be a little crisper but besides that this is great. 8.', '2005-01-06 18:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
