(1095358, 131898, 22970, '<td valign="top">Your photograph meet the challenge but I don''t think your photograph is above average. I think it is because your lines leads my eyes of the image. And the subject is not interesting in its current POV. You did a good job of focus in the Top-Left power point of the rule of thirds but if I was to take the title along with the challenge away from this photograph, it could not stand on it''s on. Good luck in the challenge and I wish you well.</td>', 'Your photograph meet the challenge but I don''t think your photograph is above average. I think it is because your lines leads my eyes of the image. And the subject is not interesting in its current POV. You did a good job of focus in the Top-Left power point of the rule of thirds but if I was to take the title along with the challenge away from this photograph, it could not stand on it''s on. Good luck in the challenge and I wish you well.', '2005-01-06 23:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095369, 132327, 22970, '<td valign="top">A very good new years resolution to have, we need more parents like that. Now to your photograph. It looks like a snapshot with very little planning. I would of picked a different setting to take the shot with a less distracting background and maybe include yourself in the picture to potray more emotion. Your subject has a very vivid light source that causes burnout on the right side of the face and neck along with a portion of the color. Other than that Good focus and color. Love the red hair/auburn hair. 5</td>', 'A very good new years resolution to have, we need more parents like that. Now to your photograph. It looks like a snapshot with very little planning. I would of picked a different setting to take the shot with a less distracting background and maybe include yourself in the picture to potray more emotion. Your subject has a very vivid light source that causes burnout on the right side of the face and neck along with a portion of the color. Other than that Good focus and color. Love the red hair/auburn hair. 5', '2005-01-06 23:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
