(1095401, 132102, 30861, '<td valign="top">Gritty and even appropriately disgusting, but not entirely satisfactory as an image to me. I wish the left side weren''t so washed out, it''s seriously pulling my eye away from the focal point.</td>', 'Gritty and even appropriately disgusting, but not entirely satisfactory as an image to me. I wish the left side weren''t so washed out, it''s seriously pulling my eye away from the focal point.', '2005-01-06 23:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095405, 131776, 30861, '<td valign="top">A lot about this image is appealing to me, but I feel the composition is out-of-balance. There''s not enough interest in the water to the left to sustain me, and the dynamics of the image are forcing me over there. I believe it would work better if the foreground were cropped so all of the third reflection from the right was visible, and only a bit more. Id this exact image were cropped to that more horizontal format, it would work better for me already; and if the picture had been framed that way, so there were more reeds at the top, it mught work better yet. Depends on what was up there, It''s conceptually very nice.</td>', 'A lot about this image is appealing to me, but I feel the composition is out-of-balance. There''s not enough interest in the water to the left to sustain me, and the dynamics of the image are forcing me over there. I believe it would work better if the foreground were cropped so all of the third reflection from the right was visible, and only a bit more. Id this exact image were cropped to that more horizontal format, it would work better for me already; and if the picture had been framed that way, so there were more reeds at the top, it mught work better yet. Depends on what was up there, It''s conceptually very nice.', '2005-01-07 00:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1095406, 132403, 30861, '<td valign="top">A nice storyline. Congrats on your pregnancy. The lighting, composition, and color give this the feel of a snapshot, not an image into which a great deal of thought was invested.</td>', 'A nice storyline. Congrats on your pregnancy. The lighting, composition, and color give this the feel of a snapshot, not an image into which a great deal of thought was invested.', '2005-01-07 00:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
