(1096156, 132381, 26741, '<td valign="top">Very nice, clear detail on the leaf and branches!</td>', 'Very nice, clear detail on the leaf and branches!', '2005-01-07 16:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096159, 132203, 26741, '<td valign="top">A little too dark for me.</td>', 'A little too dark for me.', '2005-01-07 16:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096161, 132055, 26741, '<td valign="top">I like the setup...all except for the hairy leg in the background.  I found that very distracting.  Very clear with nice colors, though.</td>', 'I like the setup...all except for the hairy leg in the background.  I found that very distracting.  Very clear with nice colors, though.', '2005-01-07 16:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096165, 132483, 26741, '<td valign="top">Neat concept, needs some attention to detail...like a better manicurist!</td>', 'Neat concept, needs some attention to detail...like a better manicurist!', '2005-01-07 16:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096167, 132378, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite image in the challenge.  I love the simplicity, composition, and feeling of winterness.  Bravo on an incredible image.  I really hope it does well.  10</td>', 'This is my favorite image in the challenge.  I love the simplicity, composition, and feeling of winterness.  Bravo on an incredible image.  I really hope it does well.  10', '2005-01-07 16:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096169, 132369, 26741, '<td valign="top">Creepy</td>', 'Creepy', '2005-01-07 16:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096170, 132403, 26741, '<td valign="top">CONGRATS!!</td>', 'CONGRATS!!', '2005-01-07 16:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096172, 132231, 6349, '<td valign="top">I hope you become less depressive too.  However, don''t stop letting that feeling out creatively, cause it''s beautiful.  The setting, composition, model, lighting, and processing are all beautiful.  10</td>', 'I hope you become less depressive too.  However, don''t stop letting that feeling out creatively, cause it''s beautiful.  The setting, composition, model, lighting, and processing are all beautiful.  10', '2005-01-07 16:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096174, 132467, 26741, '<td valign="top">I hope the money in the shredder isn''t real!! :0)</td>', 'I hope the money in the shredder isn''t real!! :0)', '2005-01-07 16:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096175, 132181, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is extraordinary.  Amazingly creative and professional looking work.  I will be very surprised if this doesn''t take a ribbon.  10</td>', 'This is extraordinary.  Amazingly creative and professional looking work.  I will be very surprised if this doesn''t take a ribbon.  10', '2005-01-07 16:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096176, 132316, 6349, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This is by far the best of the get in shape photos.  You done a great job with the colors and composition as well as depicting the motion of pedaling.  I predict a ribbon for this one.  10</td>', 'Wow.  This is by far the best of the get in shape photos.  You done a great job with the colors and composition as well as depicting the motion of pedaling.  I predict a ribbon for this one.  10', '2005-01-07 16:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096178, 132424, 26741, '<td valign="top">Nice gams!! I think I''ll work on trying to get calves like that!</td>', 'Nice gams!! I think I''ll work on trying to get calves like that!', '2005-01-07 16:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096179, 132369, 6349, '<td valign="top">Oh man, you''ve done this.  This multiple exposure was fantastic to come across in this challenge and somehow very fitting and poignant.  I''ve done a lot of similar stuff so I know how hard it can be to get this sort of shot the way you want it.  I think you did an excellent job here and I can feel your stare looking at me across cyberspace.  I must remember to add this to my favorites (it''s full now and I''ve got to clear it out first...but no worries).. 10</td>', 'Oh man, you''ve done this.  This multiple exposure was fantastic to come across in this challenge and somehow very fitting and poignant.  I''ve done a lot of similar stuff so I know how hard it can be to get this sort of shot the way you want it.  I think you did an excellent job here and I can feel your stare looking at me across cyberspace.  I must remember to add this to my favorites (it''s full now and I''ve got to clear it out first...but no worries).. 10', '2005-01-07 16:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096181, 132210, 26741, '<td valign="top">Come on, now..you didn''t get those pythons using a 2 lb. weight!! :0)</td>', 'Come on, now..you didn''t get those pythons using a 2 lb. weight!! :0)', '2005-01-07 17:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096182, 132015, 26741, '<td valign="top">Love the contrasting colors.  What is this???</td>', 'Love the contrasting colors.  What is this???', '2005-01-07 17:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096183, 132127, 6349, '<td valign="top">I think shooting photos like this would be alright!  I know what you mean though, I have that problem as well.  I take tons and tons of photos and I know that most of them are crap but I can''t help myself and it takes away from actually partaking and enjoying in where I am and what I am doing, esp. the peace of a voyage into nature.  The only problem with this beautiful image is that some of the dodging and burning is a little obvious in areas but I don''t really mind that sort of look.  10</td>', 'I think shooting photos like this would be alright!  I know what you mean though, I have that problem as well.  I take tons and tons of photos and I know that most of them are crap but I can''t help myself and it takes away from actually partaking and enjoying in where I am and what I am doing, esp. the peace of a voyage into nature.  The only problem with this beautiful image is that some of the dodging and burning is a little obvious in areas but I don''t really mind that sort of look.  10', '2005-01-07 17:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096185, 132296, 26741, '<td valign="top">Being a mom, this tugged at my heart strings.  I know this sad look.  I like the lighting</td>', 'Being a mom, this tugged at my heart strings.  I know this sad look.  I like the lighting', '2005-01-07 17:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096187, 131855, 26741, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clarity!</td>', 'Beautiful clarity!', '2005-01-07 17:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096188, 131754, 26741, '<td valign="top">VERY neat image!  Unique idea!  I wish the hand were a little less grainy, but I suppose that is technically very difficult with the different depths of focus!</td>', 'VERY neat image!  Unique idea!  I wish the hand were a little less grainy, but I suppose that is technically very difficult with the different depths of focus!', '2005-01-07 17:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096247, 132169, 10402, '<td valign="top">Simple, attractive composition. The reflections in the bottle are nice. The glare on the table is a bit distracting; a polarizer might have helped.</td>', 'Simple, attractive composition. The reflections in the bottle are nice. The glare on the table is a bit distracting; a polarizer might have helped.', '2005-01-07 18:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096251, 132157, 10402, '<td valign="top">The color enhances the mood; good choice. I think putting the horizon lower, showing more sky, would have improved the composition.</td>', 'The color enhances the mood; good choice. I think putting the horizon lower, showing more sky, would have improved the composition.', '2005-01-07 18:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096253, 132274, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, and certainly interesting. A bit blurry, though. And the lighting produced some hot spots.</td>', 'Nice composition, and certainly interesting. A bit blurry, though. And the lighting produced some hot spots.', '2005-01-07 18:25:33.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1096254, 132001, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and I like the tree. But I find the out of focus foreground plant a bit too overpowering.</td>', 'Nice idea, and I like the tree. But I find the out of focus foreground plant a bit too overpowering.', '2005-01-07 18:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096260, 132231, 10402, '<td valign="top">Very moody. I especially like how the column divides the photo into two parts, separating the model from the bulk of the photo; ugly though it may be, it beats isolation. Very well done!</td>', 'Very moody. I especially like how the column divides the photo into two parts, separating the model from the bulk of the photo; ugly though it may be, it beats isolation. Very well done!', '2005-01-07 18:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096263, 132181, 16829, '<td valign="top">A beautiful picture. Better focus maybe? It''s just lacking that final oomph that would make it a 10.</td>', 'A beautiful picture. Better focus maybe? It''s just lacking that final oomph that would make it a 10.', '2005-01-07 18:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096265, 132308, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice setup and composition, although the seam is distracting. Better lighting is needed to avoid the bright spots.</td>', 'Nice setup and composition, although the seam is distracting. Better lighting is needed to avoid the bright spots.', '2005-01-07 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096266, 131898, 10402, '<td valign="top">The shallow DOF makes the point of view work here.</td>', 'The shallow DOF makes the point of view work here.', '2005-01-07 18:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096267, 132137, 11895, '<td valign="top">nice idea but way too dark</td>', 'nice idea but way too dark', '2005-01-07 18:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096273, 132090, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. Sharp where it needs to be. Effective composition. Good job.<br/> <br/>Have you walked him today?</td>', 'Nice portrait. Sharp where it needs to be. Effective composition. Good job. Have you walked him today?', '2005-01-07 18:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096278, 132256, 10402, '<td valign="top">A common snapshot. Not very interesting unless you know the subjects.</td>', 'A common snapshot. Not very interesting unless you know the subjects.', '2005-01-07 18:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096280, 132123, 22479, '<td valign="top">I like the way the foreground scenery remains well exposed with all the fireworks working in the background. The sharp shadows paint the landscape. The figure standing next to the vehicle is also a nice touch. I tried shooting some fireworks with quite dismal results and I salute you for such splendid results, bravo!<br/> <br/>Bumping up.</td>', 'I like the way the foreground scenery remains well exposed with all the fireworks working in the background. The sharp shadows paint the landscape. The figure standing next to the vehicle is also a nice touch. I tried shooting some fireworks with quite dismal results and I salute you for such splendid results, bravo! Bumping up.', '2005-01-07 18:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096282, 131762, 22479, '<td valign="top">Revisiting for some comments.<br/> <br/>The mood is quite fitting here. The model''s expression is very mysterious and dark, especially the way he challenges the camera with his piercing eyes. The swirling fog adds the right amount of mystique as well. Bumping up.</td>', 'Revisiting for some comments. The mood is quite fitting here. The model''s expression is very mysterious and dark, especially the way he challenges the camera with his piercing eyes. The swirling fog adds the right amount of mystique as well. Bumping up.', '2005-01-07 18:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096284, 132199, 10402, '<td valign="top">The elements are nicely arranged, but the lighting isn''t very effective. The photo lacks depth, and the shadows are unrealistic.</td>', 'The elements are nicely arranged, but the lighting isn''t very effective. The photo lacks depth, and the shadows are unrealistic.', '2005-01-07 19:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096288, 132381, 10402, '<td valign="top">Seeing is what photography is all about, and this is a good example. The leaf is interesting and its contrasting setting here works well.</td>', 'Seeing is what photography is all about, and this is a good example. The leaf is interesting and its contrasting setting here works well.', '2005-01-07 19:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096315, 132157, 22379, '<td valign="top">i dream about trees like that!</td>', 'i dream about trees like that!', '2005-01-07 19:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096370, 132461, 164, '<td valign="top">Making this Black and white makes the treess too dark and not very promising.</td>', 'Making this Black and white makes the treess too dark and not very promising.', '2005-01-07 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096376, 132244, 164, '<td valign="top">Good lighting technique. Angle also accentuates the gut.</td>', 'Good lighting technique. Angle also accentuates the gut.', '2005-01-07 20:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096377, 131769, 164, '<td valign="top">in the dark?</td>', 'in the dark?', '2005-01-07 20:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096378, 132044, 164, '<td valign="top">Nice start</td>', 'Nice start', '2005-01-07 20:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096379, 132157, 164, '<td valign="top">amen!</td>', 'amen!', '2005-01-07 20:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096401, 132223, 11895, '<td valign="top">cropped awfully close, a little noisy, color may have been better</td>', 'cropped awfully close, a little noisy, color may have been better', '2005-01-07 21:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096446, 131855, 11895, '<td valign="top">somrthing about this doesn''t look natural, maybe over sharpenned, but on the whole a pretty decent shot</td>', 'somrthing about this doesn''t look natural, maybe over sharpenned, but on the whole a pretty decent shot', '2005-01-07 21:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096524, 132387, 11895, '<td valign="top">the resolution is better than the photograph,  wny not color?</td>', 'the resolution is better than the photograph,  wny not color?', '2005-01-07 22:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096753, 132305, 16046, '<td valign="top">looks like a Tae kwon do uniform, good tones, I''m a black belt myself.</td>', 'looks like a Tae kwon do uniform, good tones, I''m a black belt myself.', '2005-01-08 04:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096754, 132369, 16046, '<td valign="top">very cool, excellent transition with the two exposures, good work</td>', 'very cool, excellent transition with the two exposures, good work', '2005-01-08 04:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096758, 132398, 16046, '<td valign="top">very good</td>', 'very good', '2005-01-08 04:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096760, 131762, 16046, '<td valign="top">excellent work, a rare 10 from me</td>', 'excellent work, a rare 10 from me', '2005-01-08 04:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096780, 131873, 22970, '<td valign="top">Not to clean of a photograph. What I mean by that is there seems to be to much artifacts in the snow, path, and road. Giving a good example, the road, look on the right top power point of the top third or the rule of thirds. In case I didn''t explain myself well that''s where the first third line horizontally and the third line vertically intersect. It looks like a snake in the road? I think a neater picture would of served better. I think a colored version would of worked better.</td>', 'Not to clean of a photograph. What I mean by that is there seems to be to much artifacts in the snow, path, and road. Giving a good example, the road, look on the right top power point of the top third or the rule of thirds. In case I didn''t explain myself well that''s where the first third line horizontally and the third line vertically intersect. It looks like a snake in the road? I think a neater picture would of served better. I think a colored version would of worked better.', '2005-01-08 05:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096787, 131828, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea for the challenge. Your colors and focus are great but the shadows are harsh. You have somethings that are distracting to me. You photograph leads my eyes to the glass [thats good] but the class has a lot of reflections with is distracting [thats bad]. Plus it looks like some dust particles on the class that catches my attention. Base and background good but where you photograph lacks is the glass [dust,reflections] and the hard light coming from the left. High Average 5. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice Idea for the challenge. Your colors and focus are great but the shadows are harsh. You have somethings that are distracting to me. You photograph leads my eyes to the glass [thats good] but the class has a lot of reflections with is distracting [thats bad]. Plus it looks like some dust particles on the class that catches my attention. Base and background good but where you photograph lacks is the glass [dust,reflections] and the hard light coming from the left. High Average 5. Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-01-08 05:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096789, 131736, 22970, '<td valign="top">Well  I must say its an original photograph and probably one of the most candid. I like the colors, focus, and lighting. Not much I can find wrong because the clutter on the desk makes it a candid look. I don''t think it''s an above average shot but I do give it a high average on my voting scale 5. BTW cute baby pictures on the wall. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well  I must say its an original photograph and probably one of the most candid. I like the colors, focus, and lighting. Not much I can find wrong because the clutter on the desk makes it a candid look. I don''t think it''s an above average shot but I do give it a high average on my voting scale 5. BTW cute baby pictures on the wall. Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-01-08 05:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096793, 131754, 22970, '<td valign="top">Creative and good lighting and focus. I''m guessing a print out of the moon on black paper keeping both hand and moon in focus???. Any way its a good shot, bump to 7.</td>', 'Creative and good lighting and focus. I''m guessing a print out of the moon on black paper keeping both hand and moon in focus???. Any way its a good shot, bump to 7.', '2005-01-08 05:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096833, 131911, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice color contrast and good focus. All around good photograph 6</td>', 'Nice color contrast and good focus. All around good photograph 6', '2005-01-08 06:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096836, 131766, 22970, '<td valign="top">Your subject is not a very good photogenic subject but I like the play on humor. Nice colors on a good smooth background. Seeds kind of out of focus. Subject [Not the meaning] is bland. I give it a high average because you did a good job on lighting and focus with humor [5]. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Your subject is not a very good photogenic subject but I like the play on humor. Nice colors on a good smooth background. Seeds kind of out of focus. Subject [Not the meaning] is bland. I give it a high average because you did a good job on lighting and focus with humor [5]. Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-01-08 06:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096837, 132231, 22970, '<td valign="top">IMO a very good job! I like the mood of the picture and the topic of the resolution. I like the use of coloring it the picture and think you did a great job. Lighting is good along with the focus. The pillar/column and subject has a crisp focus while the background is blending out, great DOF. Great Job [9].</td>', 'IMO a very good job! I like the mood of the picture and the topic of the resolution. I like the use of coloring it the picture and think you did a great job. Lighting is good along with the focus. The pillar/column and subject has a crisp focus while the background is blending out, great DOF. Great Job [9].', '2005-01-08 07:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096843, 132299, 22970, '<td valign="top">Something about your picture looks odd. It looks like it''s floating in air and the tank is rising. If I was a drinker I would be doing the same thing. With that said your photograph has good lighting on the subject along with good color and focus. Without the distortion I mentioned above I think this would of been a great shot. But it distracts my eyes. As is I think it is a good shot and give it a 6. Good luck in the challenge, I wish you well.</td>', 'Something about your picture looks odd. It looks like it''s floating in air and the tank is rising. If I was a drinker I would be doing the same thing. With that said your photograph has good lighting on the subject along with good color and focus. Without the distortion I mentioned above I think this would of been a great shot. But it distracts my eyes. As is I think it is a good shot and give it a 6. Good luck in the challenge, I wish you well.', '2005-01-08 07:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096845, 132298, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, lighting and shadows. Hope your dream comes true. Wish you well in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice colors, lighting and shadows. Hope your dream comes true. Wish you well in the challenge.', '2005-01-08 07:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096846, 131913, 22970, '<td valign="top">An average photograph with good color and focus. I don''t like the tilt of the book, it''s to little. I believe if you would of tilted it more diagonal you would of had a better picture. It would of placed the watch and passport on the thirds. The way it is not I keep looking at the passport and the money gets blended in with the shallow focus on the writing on the bottom of the book. Good luck, wish you well in the challenge.</td>', 'An average photograph with good color and focus. I don''t like the tilt of the book, it''s to little. I believe if you would of tilted it more diagonal you would of had a better picture. It would of placed the watch and passport on the thirds. The way it is not I keep looking at the passport and the money gets blended in with the shallow focus on the writing on the bottom of the book. Good luck, wish you well in the challenge.', '2005-01-08 07:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096848, 131974, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice use of soft and hard focus with good lighting. However the picture is missing something. I don''t know if its the long horizontal crop or the fact that the main subject is centered.</td>', 'Nice use of soft and hard focus with good lighting. However the picture is missing something. I don''t know if its the long horizontal crop or the fact that the main subject is centered.', '2005-01-08 07:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096850, 132210, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good focus and lighting along with good skin tones. You do have a distracting smudge spot on the shoulder and the chest perspective looks a bit off. Other than that good shot 6.</td>', 'Good focus and lighting along with good skin tones. You do have a distracting smudge spot on the shoulder and the chest perspective looks a bit off. Other than that good shot 6.', '2005-01-08 07:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096858, 132215, 17850, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, simple and nice shot!</td>', 'Clever idea, simple and nice shot!', '2005-01-08 07:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096861, 132424, 17850, '<td valign="top">...awesome shot!!</td>', '...awesome shot!!', '2005-01-08 08:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096866, 131770, 17850, '<td valign="top">Very expressive photo,  lighting, angle and the focus tone are very effective</td>', 'Very expressive photo,  lighting, angle and the focus tone are very effective', '2005-01-08 08:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096867, 131769, 17850, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a photo from another world,  very good photo</td>', 'Seems to be a photo from another world,  very good photo', '2005-01-08 08:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096869, 132344, 17850, '<td valign="top">Color choice is excellent, the angle is very good, overall an impressive photo</td>', 'Color choice is excellent, the angle is very good, overall an impressive photo', '2005-01-08 08:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096871, 132181, 17850, '<td valign="top">It''s magic shot! Congratulations!</td>', 'It''s magic shot! Congratulations!', '2005-01-08 08:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096876, 132316, 17850, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely stunning photo! Good luck (10)</td>', 'This is an absolutely stunning photo! Good luck (10)', '2005-01-08 08:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096903, 132296, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.</td>', 'Nice capture.', '2005-01-08 09:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096960, 132364, 25232, '<td valign="top">This shot is a bit cliche, in fact there are one or two others in this chalenge with the same theme, but it is wellexecuted, sharp, and well composed. I give it a high score.</td>', 'This shot is a bit cliche, in fact there are one or two others in this chalenge with the same theme, but it is wellexecuted, sharp, and well composed. I give it a high score.', '2005-01-08 11:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096962, 132231, 25232, '<td valign="top">Very artistic. Conveys the mood well.</td>', 'Very artistic. Conveys the mood well.', '2005-01-08 11:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096964, 132157, 25232, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Great composition. Reflects a mood well. I don''t think it does much to reflect the theme of this chalenge but it seems as close as most of the others at this point. I don''t think you will get many bad comments on this.</td>', 'Nice picture. Great composition. Reflects a mood well. I don''t think it does much to reflect the theme of this chalenge but it seems as close as most of the others at this point. I don''t think you will get many bad comments on this.', '2005-01-08 11:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1096967, 132398, 25232, '<td valign="top">Nice John Travolta action blur. Really conveys the speed. Maybe too centered?</td>', 'Nice John Travolta action blur. Really conveys the speed. Maybe too centered?', '2005-01-08 11:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
