(1098073, 131754, 23478, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments... for some reason, I had a hard time keeping the hand &amp; the picture of the moon in focus.  I took a variety of shots at various exposures &amp; f stops and the hand was usually blurry.  If fact, that is one reason I changed it to B&amp;W, because the color looked really odd.  I think that is one reason it did not do better.  It was definitely a fun photo, something different for me.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments... for some reason, I had a hard time keeping the hand & the picture of the moon in focus.  I took a variety of shots at various exposures & f stops and the hand was usually blurry.  If fact, that is one reason I changed it to B&W, because the color looked really odd.  I think that is one reason it did not do better.  It was definitely a fun photo, something different for me.', '2005-01-09 10:08:38.000000', NULL, 0),
