(1098302, 132330, 10080, '<td valign="top">Thanks soo much for all the positive comments and support! Gracie thanks you also! Another of my resolutions is to get her a ribbon this year. Hopefully she''ll grace all the spots in my top rated photos eventually. I know kid portraits don''t do all that well in challenges.....but thats what I do, and what I LOVE. All of the top shots deserved their placings! Well done everyone!</td>', 'Thanks soo much for all the positive comments and support! Gracie thanks you also! Another of my resolutions is to get her a ribbon this year. Hopefully she''ll grace all the spots in my top rated photos eventually. I know kid portraits don''t do all that well in challenges.....but thats what I do, and what I LOVE. All of the top shots deserved their placings! Well done everyone!', '2005-01-09 12:43:57.000000', NULL, 0),
