(1098681, 131947, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think people somewhat over-react to frames ... I think when most people say they "don''t like the border," what they may really mean is that they want to choose their own ... almost no-one would take your cropped photo and mount it in a "floating" frame -- they''d want to choose their own mat/frame combination.<br/> <br/>It may not be "smart" voting-wise to use them on challenge entries, but I don''t think that should dissuade you from a degree of experimentation.</td>', 'I think people somewhat over-react to frames ... I think when most people say they "don''t like the border," what they may really mean is that they want to choose their own ... almost no-one would take your cropped photo and mount it in a "floating" frame -- they''d want to choose their own mat/frame combination. It may not be "smart" voting-wise to use them on challenge entries, but I don''t think that should dissuade you from a degree of experimentation.', '2005-01-09 18:34:18.000000', NULL, 0),
