(1099339, 132483, 22384, '<td valign="top">This is what truly sucks...er...blows...whatever. I am NOT a smoker. I didn''t read the rules carefully and shot just any ol'' New Year''s Resolution. I tried to have myself DQed but they wouldn''t do it. Want to know something even worse? That is my daughter pretending to smoke. She did a smoker''s resolution, too. (She is also a non-smoker. At least she better be!)This is so not funny. My students will never let me live it down that I didn''t read the directions carefully. Wait... I think I hear social services knocking at the door. Gotta go...better hide my daughter...</td>', 'This is what truly sucks...er...blows...whatever. I am NOT a smoker. I didn''t read the rules carefully and shot just any ol'' New Year''s Resolution. I tried to have myself DQed but they wouldn''t do it. Want to know something even worse? That is my daughter pretending to smoke. She did a smoker''s resolution, too. (She is also a non-smoker. At least she better be!)This is so not funny. My students will never let me live it down that I didn''t read the directions carefully. Wait... I think I hear social services knocking at the door. Gotta go...better hide my daughter...', '2005-01-10 03:15:42.000000', NULL, 0),
